OL,3,GNEWSAWatch thieves take #1m a month,
OL,4,Acourt hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn average of #1m worth of watches is
OL,7,Fstolen from people's wrists in London's
OL,8,FWest End every month, police have said.
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police figure was
OL,11,Fgiven to Southwark Crown Court at the
OL,12,Fsentencing hearing of three men who
OL,13,Ftook a #137,000 watch from a Romanian
OL,14,Fbusinessman in Mayfair.
OL,16,FThere were 97 watch robberies,
OL,17,Fincluding attempts, across Westminster,
OL,18,FKensington and Chelsea, and Hammersmith
OL,19,Fand Fulham between January and June,
OL,20,Fout of 1,196 robberies in those
OL,21,Fboroughs.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
